{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, approach and pick up. Process it. If obstacle, avoid. Move randomly.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = RandomMovement    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    />",
